								"html": "<p>\n\tThe Salvation Army Women’s Auxiliary of Greenville is the only auxiliary in the state of South Carolina. &nbsp;It is a committed volunteer group dedicated to doing the most good in our community. Meetings are held on the 2nd Wednesday of each month (except July) at 11:30 a.m. at the Kroc Center located at 42 Westfield Street in Greenville (lunch is served).&nbsp;\n</p>",
